msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"  Unfortunately, during my 'voyage' to this lighthouse, luck turned away from"
" me.  I was attacked by some dreadful creature from the underwater depths.  I"
" couldn't fight off him and he dragged my ship to the bottom.  The waves "
"brought me straight to the shore of this little island.  I still don't "
"understand by what miracle I managed to survive, <name_g>."
msgstr ""

